Package: tabs3-dashboard
Version: 0.1.9
Architecture: all
Maintainer: tabS3 Project <root@localhost>
Depends: tabs3-base (>= 0.1.25), python3, python3-pil, fonts-b612, fonts-dejavu-core, kbd, iproute2
Recommends: tabs3-sensors, v4l-utils
Suggests: fonts-inter, fonts-jetbrains-mono, fonts-manrope, fonts-cascadia-code, fonts-sora, fonts-hack, fonts-adobe-sourcesans3, fonts-atkinson-hyperlegible
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Server status on the Galaxy Tab S3 LTE's own panel
 Draws clock, load, temperatures, battery, memory, storage, network and
 firmware state straight into the panel's framebuffer, and wakes the screen
 when the light sensor, the accelerometer, the microphone or the front
 camera notice someone.
